</div><div class="jackson-state-help-section bg-green-gradient">
  <div class="jackson-state-section">
    <div class="container">
      
      <div class="section-title text-center">
        <h3>Why Jackson State?</h3>
      </div>
      
      <div class="jackson-state-content">
        <div class="common-accordion">
          <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
            <div class="row">
<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6">
  <div class="accordion-item">
    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="heading11183">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse11183" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse11183">
        Low Tuition / Great Scholarships
      </button>
    </h4>
    <div id="collapse11183" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
      <div class="accordion-body">
        <div class="detail small-text">
          <p>We understand that paying for college can be difficult for many students. We also understand that applying for financial aid can be overwhelming. We are here to assist you in getting the financial resources necessary to obtain your goal of a college degree.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-buttons-list">
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="/costs-aid#" role="button">Costs and Aid</a>
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="/costs-and-aid/types-of-aid/scholarships/#" role="button">Scholarships</a>
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="https://jscc.awardspring.com/Home/Scholarships" role="button">Foundation Scholarships</a>
          
          
          
          
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div><div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6">
  <div class="accordion-item">
    <h4 class="accordion-header" id="heading11184">
      <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse11184" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse11184">
        Student Resources + Get Involved
      </button>
    </h4>
    <div id="collapse11184" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
      <div class="accordion-body">
        <div class="detail small-text">
          <p>Looking for ways to get involved at JSCC or resources to boost your success? Check out the topics below, to learn more!&nbsp;</p>
<p>P.S. We offer a Study Abroad Program through Global Learning that sends students across the globe (scholarships available).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-buttons-list">
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="/campus-life-services/#" role="button">Campus Life & Services</a>
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="/campus-life-services/sga/sga#" role="button">Get Involved</a>
          
          <a class="btn btn-arrow btn-tertiary btn-arrow" href="/about/locations/#" role="button">JSCC Locations</a>
          
