          <p>Check out JSCC's athletic program featuring top-tier athletic programs drawing students from across the regions. Jackson State provides a competitive platform for student athletes to compete at the Division I and II NJCAA level.</p>
<p>Choose a category below to get to know the Green Jays.</p>
