            <p>
              <strong><a class="t4Edit-page" href="https://jsccedu-cms01-production.terminalfour.net/terminalfour/page/directEdit#edit/3/en/8310">Jackson</a></strong> State Community College is a <a href="http://www.tbr.edu/">Tennessee Board of Regents</a> institution. All rights reserved.
